{"type":"message","id":"3976cf8a","parentId":"12889502","timestamp":"2026-03-14T10:25:20.071Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"可以看到页面加载成功了，是厦门火炬高技术产业开发区的信息公开页面。我可以看到：\n\n1. 有\"信息公开\"导航栏\n2. 有\"通知公告\"分类\n3. 页面展示了多个公告条目\n4. 每个条目有标题、日期、来源部门\n\n让我用 Playwright 提取更详细的 HTML 内容来分析结构并获取完整的公告列表。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_934aeb630e7a472ca276c221","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"playwright evaluate --url http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/zfxxgkml/glfw/ '\n  (() => {\n    const items = document.querySelectorAll(\".lis-li, .news_list li, .xxgk-list li, .container li, .article-list li, .ul-list li\");\n    const results = [];\n    items.forEach((item, i) => {\n      const titleEl = item.querySelector(\"a\");\n      const dateEl = item.querySelector(\"span, .date, .time\");\n      if (titleEl) {\n        results.push({\n          index: i + 1,\n          title: titleEl.textContent?.trim() || titleEl.innerText?.trim(),\n          url: titleEl.href,\n          date: dateEl ? (dateEl.textContent?.trim() || dateEl.innerText?.trim()) : \"\"\n        });\n      }\n    });\n    return results;\n  })()\n' 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773483904296}}
