{"type":"message","id":"baa055a8","parentId":"98748c7d","timestamp":"2026-03-14T10:26:50.940Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我现在可以看到页面的结构了。我找到了公告列表，里面有实际的公告内容。让我更精确地提取所有公告，包括完整的URL和日期。\n\n从上面的输出可以看到，公告是以 `./sbxmzj/...` 的形式存在的，需要补充完整域名。\n\n我需要更仔细地抓取所有公告。让我修改脚本来获取所有公告，包括完整的URL。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！现在让我提取完整的公告列表：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5d86f8a6c06c45b7a2decc70","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > /tmp/scrape_torch_full.py << 'EOF'\nfrom playwright.sync_api import sync_playwright\nimport json\n\nwith sync_playwright() as p:\n    browser = p.chromium.launch()\n    page = browser.newPage()\n    page.goto('http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn/xxgk/zfxxgkml/glfw/', wait_until='networkidle')\n    \n    base_url = 'http://xmtorch.xm.gov.cn'\n    \n    # 使用更精确的选择器获取公告列表\n    # 从截图看，公告在特定的列表容器中\n    results = []\n    \n    # 查找所有包含日期的链接\n    all_elements = page.query_selector_all('a')\n    \n    for link in all_elements:\n        try:\n            text = link.inner_text().strip()\n            href = link.get_attribute('href')\n            \n            # 跳过空白和导航链接\n            if not text or len(text) < 5:\n                continue\n            if href and ('#' in href or 'javascript' in href.lower()):\n                continue\n            if 'beian' in text.lower() or '备案' in text or '首页' in text:\n                continue\n                \n            # 获取父元素查找日期\n            parent = None\n            try:\n                parent = link.evaluate('el => el.parentElement.parentElement')\n            except:\n                pass\n            \n            # 查找日期\n            date = ''\n            if parent:\n                date_el = parent.query_selector('.date, .time, span, [class*=\"date\"]')\n                if date_el:\n                    date = date_el.inner_text().strip()\n            \n            # 完整URL\n            if href:\n                if href.startswith('http'):\n                    full_url = href\n                elif href.startswith('/'):\n                    full_url = base_url + href\n                else:\n                    full_url = base_url + '/xxgk/zfxxgkml/glfw/' + href.replace('./', '/')\n                \n                # 过滤出公告类链接\n                if 'sbxmzj' in href or 't20' in href:\n                    results.append({\n                        'title': text.replace('\\n', ' ').strip(),\n                        'url': full_url,\n                        'date': date\n                    })\n        except Exception as e:\n            pass\n    \n    # 去重\n    seen = set()\n    unique_results = []\n    for r in results:\n        key = r['url']\n        if key not in seen:\n            seen.add(key)\n            unique_results.append(r)\n    \n    print(json.dumps(unique_results, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2))\n    print(f\"\\n=== Total: {len(unique_results)} announcements ===\")\n    browser.close()\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/scrape_torch_full.py 2>&1","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773483965080}}
